# Ignore rules for Dockerfile.prebuilt only.
#
# The shared ../../.dockerignore excludes **/.next, but this Dockerfile exists to
# package an already-built Next.js standalone output — it needs .next in the build
# context. Docker prefers a file named <dockerfile>.dockerignore over the shared
# one, so the exclusion can stay in place for the normal Dockerfile (where it is
# load-bearing: a stale .next is ~446 MB and shadows the directory the build writes
# into) without breaking this one.
#
# Note this applies to the whole build context, so the paths are the repo-root ones.

**/node_modules
.git
**/env
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local
**/dist
**/.source
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.nx
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
*.log
.DS_Store
.vscode
.idea
*.swp
*.swo
*~
